    "body": "## What\r\nSwitch Megatron trainer unit tests to invoke the unified CLI entrypoint:\r\n`bash ./runner/primus-cli direct -- train pretrain --config <exp> ...`\r\ninstead of the legacy `bash examples/run_pretrain.sh`.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n- Keep UT entry consistent with Primus CLI design (single entry point).\r\n- Reduce reliance on the legacy bash wrapper.\r\n- Preserve the existing UT behavior pattern (runtime output + optional TRAIN_LOG read).\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- Update `tests/trainer/test_megatron_trainer.py` to:\r\n  - use `./runner/primus-cli direct -- train pretrain --config <exp_path>`\r\n  - keep reading `TRAIN_LOG` when present (same pattern as other trainer UTs)\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n- `pytest -q tests/trainer/test_megatron_trainer.py` (environment permitting)",
    "changed_files": 2,
